  "id": "referent-power",
  "term": "referent power",
  "definition": "Referent power is a form of social influence that comes from other people’s admiration, personal liking, and identification with a leader or superior. In other words, someone has referent power when others are influenced by them because they feel drawn to or want to align themselves with that person.",
